{"content_hash": "14d309343c4c0e06", "version_id": 351, "article_id": 36, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "British women win many track medals", "title_zh": "英国女将田径场上拿奖拿到手软", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "skysports", "source_url": "https://www.skysports.com/athletics/news/12040/13596451/georgia-hunter-bell-british-800m-and-1500m-runner-celebrates-teams-female-track-success", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1656111734352-beba25e0f603?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8aHVudGVyJTIwc3BvcnRzJTIwYWN0aW9ufGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE1NTMzNDZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Aaron James on Unsplash", "author": "Aaron James", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@aaronjamesmedia_co?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-man-in-a-hat-holding-a-gun-UiUudRJblm4?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(346, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(24, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "35624543b66c"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 171, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "Georgia Hunter Bell is a British runner. She won three gold medals this year. She says her team helps her win.", "lead_zh": "乔治亚·亨特·贝尔是英国赛跑选手。今年她拿了三块金牌。她说团队帮助她获胜。", "preview": "Georgia Hunter Bell runs the 800m and 1500m. She won three gold medals in 2025. She won at the World Indoor Championships. She also won for ", "preview_zh": "乔治亚·亨特·贝尔跑800米和1500米。2025年她拿了三块金牌。她在世界室内锦标赛上夺冠。她还为英格兰队和英国队拿了金牌。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 341, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/36/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 69.975, "size_bytes": 423648, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 196, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@6e47fba/content/data/versions/351.json", "paragraphs": ["Georgia Hunter Bell runs the 800m and 1500m. She won three gold medals in 2025. She won at the World Indoor Championships. She also won for England and for Team GB.", "Other British women also did very well. Amy Hunt won four gold medals at the Europeans in Birmingham. Dina Asher-Smith now has 11 medals at the Europeans. Eight of them are gold.", "Keely Hodgkinson won World Indoor gold in the 800m in March. She ran the second-fastest indoor time in history. In the summer, she set a new British record.", "Hunter Bell says the team is like a family. They travel together and see each other a lot. When one woman wins, the others want to win too.", "The women also like to look good. Amy Hunt is famous for her nail art. Hunter Bell says feeling good gives her extra power on the start line.", "Hodgkinson wore a new hooded speed suit in London. Some people say it is very fast. Hunter Bell says she may wear one too."], "paragraphs_zh": ["乔治亚·亨特·贝尔跑800米和1500米。2025年她拿了三块金牌。她在世界室内锦标赛上夺冠。她还为英格兰队和英国队拿了金牌。", "其他英国女选手也表现很棒。艾米·亨特在伯明翰的欧锦赛上拿了四块金牌。迪娜·阿舍-史密斯现在有11块欧锦赛奖牌。其中八块是金牌。", "基莉·霍奇金森在三月赢得世界室内800米金牌。她跑出历史上第二快的室内成绩。夏天，她又创造了新的英国纪录。", "亨特·贝尔说这个团队像一家人。她们一起旅行，经常见面。当一个人赢了，其他人也想赢。", "这些女选手也喜欢打扮得漂漂亮亮。艾米·亨特的美甲很有名。亨特·贝尔说，感觉好，起跑线上就更有力量。", "霍奇金森在伦敦穿了一件新的连帽紧身比赛服。有人说这种衣服很快。亨特·贝尔说她也可能穿一件。"], "body": "Georgia Hunter Bell runs the 800m and 1500m. She won three gold medals in 2025. She won at the World Indoor Championships. She also won for England and for Team GB.\n\nOther British women also did very well. Amy Hunt won four gold medals at the Europeans in Birmingham. Dina Asher-Smith now has 11 medals at the Europeans. Eight of them are gold.\n\nKeely Hodgkinson won World Indoor gold in the 800m in March. She ran the second-fastest indoor time in history. In the summer, she set a new British record.\n\nHunter Bell says the team is like a family. They travel together and see each other a lot. When one woman wins, the others want to win too.\n\nThe women also like to look good. Amy Hunt is famous for her nail art. Hunter Bell says feeling good gives her extra power on the start line.\n\nHodgkinson wore a new hooded speed suit in London. Some people say it is very fast. Hunter Bell says she may wear one too.", "body_zh": "乔治亚·亨特·贝尔跑800米和1500米。2025年她拿了三块金牌。她在世界室内锦标赛上夺冠。她还为英格兰队和英国队拿了金牌。\n\n其他英国女选手也表现很棒。艾米·亨特在伯明翰的欧锦赛上拿了四块金牌。迪娜·阿舍-史密斯现在有11块欧锦赛奖牌。其中八块是金牌。\n\n基莉·霍奇金森在三月赢得世界室内800米金牌。她跑出历史上第二快的室内成绩。夏天，她又创造了新的英国纪录。\n\n亨特·贝尔说这个团队像一家人。她们一起旅行，经常见面。当一个人赢了，其他人也想赢。\n\n这些女选手也喜欢打扮得漂漂亮亮。艾米·亨特的美甲很有名。亨特·贝尔说，感觉好，起跑线上就更有力量。\n\n霍奇金森在伦敦穿了一件新的连帽紧身比赛服。有人说这种衣服很快。亨特·贝尔说她也可能穿一件。", "text": "Georgia Hunter Bell runs the 800m and 1500m. She won three gold medals in 2025. She won at the World Indoor Championships. She also won for England and for Team GB. Other British women also did very well. Amy Hunt won four gold medals at the Europeans in Birmingham. Dina Asher-Smith now has 11 medals at the Europeans. Eight of them are gold. Keely Hodgkinson won World Indoor gold in the 800m in March. She ran the second-fastest indoor time in history. In the summer, she set a new British record. Hunter Bell says the team is like a family. They travel together and see each other a lot. When one woman wins, the others want to win too. The women also like to look good. Amy Hunt is famous for her nail art. Hunter Bell says feeling good gives her extra power on the start line. Hodgkinson wore a new hooded speed suit in London. Some people say it is very fast. Hunter Bell says she may wear one too.", "vocab": [{"word": "gold medal", "pos": "noun", "zh": "金牌", "note": "比赛第一名获得的奖牌"}, {"word": "win", "pos": "verb", "zh": "赢；获胜", "note": "过去式是 won"}, {"word": "run", "pos": "verb", "zh": "跑；跑步", "note": "过去式是 ran"}, {"word": "team", "pos": "noun", "zh": "团队；队伍", "note": "常用搭配 Team GB 指英国队"}, {"word": "record", "pos": "noun", "zh": "纪录", "note": "set a record 创造纪录"}, {"word": "fast", "pos": "adj", "zh": "快的", "note": "比较级 faster，最高级 fastest"}, {"word": "look good", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "好看；显得漂亮", "note": "口语中常用来夸人"}, {"word": "year", "pos": "noun", "zh": "年", "note": "this year 今年"}], "title_original": "Hunter Bell celebrates in Team GB's 'glam' female track success", "summary_original": "Georgia Hunter Bell has enjoyed quite the year, winning a hat-trick of gold medals at the World Indoor Championships, for England at the Commonwealth Games, and again for Team GB at the European Championships.", "body_original": "Exclusive\nGeorgia Hunter Bell: British 800m and 1500m runner celebrates team's female track success\nGeorgia Hunter Bell, Keely Hodgkinson, Amy Hunt and Dina Asher-Smith are standout members of a strong British female core delivering medals on the track; Hunter Bell: \"We're locked into everyone's goals... someone winning or bringing home a medal, it makes you even more keen to do well\"\nThursday 8 October 2026 17:10, UK\nGeorgia Hunter Bell has enjoyed quite the year, winning a hat-trick of gold medals at the World Indoor Championships, for England at the Commonwealth Games, and again for Team GB at the European Championships.\nBut British female track success in 2025 certainly didn't stop there. Sprinter Amy Hunt made headlines with a record four-gold display in the Europeans in Birmingham, while Dina Asher-Smith now tops the all-time medal table at the championships after winning her 11th, eight of which are gold.\nAmong other successes, Keely Hodgkinson claimed World Indoor gold in the 800m in March - in the second-fastest indoor time in history - and set a new British record at that distance in the summer, though she'd be pipped to gold at the Europeans after sitting out the Commonwealth Games due to muscle tightness.\nPlease use Chrome browser for a more accessible video player\nSky Sports on WhatsApp: Breaking news, videos and analysis\nDownload the Sky Sports app for expert analysis, best video & more\nLatest Sky Sports deals\nor\nstream with no contract on NOW\n\"It's really cool. just being part of this era. It's really fun,\" Hunter Bell told\nSky Sports\n.\n\"We all know each other very well. We all travel together, see each other a lot throughout the year, so it's fun to tune in and be like, 'Oh, Amy's racing tonight'.\n\"We're locked into everyone's goals and what they're trying to do. And when you're on a team together, someone winning or bringing home a medal, it makes you even more keen to do well because you want to contribute.\"\nPlease use Chrome browser for a more accessible video player\nIn addition to her statement performances on the track during her record-breaking Europeans, Hunt earned attention for her curated nail art that gave nod to landmarks within Birmingham, like the Bull Ring.\n\"Everyone knows I love a bit of glam and I love my nails,\" Hunt told the\nBBC\nat the time.\nHunter Bell says it's something the GB squad share, as feeling your best self on the start line can provide \"that extra one or two per cent\" to make you \"feel like you can do anything\".\n\"I enjoy the whole process of getting ready. We get ready like we're going to a club, we're quite glammed up,\" Hunter Bell said.\n\"We definitely put effort into it, for sure. We want to look nice.\n\"It's about doing whatever you need to feel confident on the start line - and I just think it makes you race better if you're feeling good about yourself.\n\"So much of that comes from the training and the lead up, of course. But it's that extra one or two per cent that makes you stand on the start line and feel like you can do anything, feel like you're a winner.\"\nIn terms of eye-catching track looks, Hodgkinson dominated the final race of her 2026 season by winning the 800m at Athlos in London last month as she debuted a new full-length, hooded speed suit.\nHodgkinson's outfit reminded people of Australian Cathy Freeman's which she won the women's 400m in at the 2000 Sydney Olympics, and it could be a feature for athletes at the next Olympics in Los Angeles in 2028.\nHunter Bell didn't rule out being one of them to don the suit.\n\"The first time you see it, it's like, 'Whoa! Haven't seen that before',\" she said. \"It will be interesting to see whether it becomes the norm.\n\"They do say it's quicker, so I'm definitely not ruling it out.\"\nAround Sky\nUpgrade to get all of Sky Sports, including 1500 live football matches this season\nNot got Sky? Get instant access to Sky Sports with no contract", "fetched_at": "2026-10-09T01:24:15.123300", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Georgia", "s": 0.1, "e": 0.512, "sm": 100, "em": 512, "cs": 0, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Hunter", "s": 0.525, "e": 0.863, "sm": 525, "em": 862, "cs": 8, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "Bell", "s": 0.875, "e": 1.163, "sm": 875, "em": 1162, "cs": 15, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "runs", "s": 1.175, "e": 1.438, "sm": 1175, "em": 1437, "cs": 20, "ce": 24, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "the", "s": 1.45, "e": 1.55, "sm": 1450, "em": 1550, "cs": 25, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "800", "s": 1.562, "e": 2.153, "sm": 1562, "em": 2153, "cs": 29, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "m", "s": 2.153, "e": 2.35, "sm": 2153, "em": 2350, "cs": 32, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "and", "s": 2.362, "e": 2.462, "sm": 2362, "em": 2462, "cs": 34, "ce": 37, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "1500", "s": 2.475, "e": 3.385, "sm": 2475, "em": 3385, "cs": 38, "ce": 42, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "m", "s": 3.385, "e": 3.612, "sm": 3385, "em": 3612, "cs": 42, "ce": 43, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": ".", "s": 3.612, "e": 4.487, "sm": 3612, "em": 4487, "cs": 43, "ce": 44, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "She", "s": 4.487, "e": 4.725, "sm": 4487, "em": 4725, "cs": 45, "ce": 48, "si": 1}, {"i": 12, "w": "won", "s": 4.737, "e": 4.962, "sm": 4737, "em": 4962, "cs": 49, "ce": 52, "si": 1}, {"i": 13, "w": "three", "s": 4.975, "e": 5.237, "sm": 4975, "em": 5237, "cs": 53, "ce": 58, "si": 1}, {"i": 14, "w": "gold", "s": 5.25, "e": 5.513, "sm": 5250, "em": 5512, "cs": 59, "ce": 63, "si": 1}, {"i": 15, "w": "medals", "s": 5.52